{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/33296e4f91ebe7a5ab65ee428886d179.poster.avif?t=1761699714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/33296e4f91ebe7a5ab65ee428886d179.webm?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/33296e4f91ebe7a5ab65ee428886d179.mp4?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessing In The Darkness is a 2D turn based survival dungeon crawler game where every step counts.  <br><br>Crossing dark dungeons teeming with dark and fiendish foes. The fight under death eyes defy the glory of  church and all that still live in the village. You control a brave cleric who accepted this quest. Keeping faith and just go ahead with wisdom! It will lead to the victory of light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/6b0ca7491a96ebd4c4eee71ba664c714.poster.avif?t=1761699714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/6b0ca7491a96ebd4c4eee71ba664c714.webm?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/6b0ca7491a96ebd4c4eee71ba664c714.mp4?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evil is just an event between life and death.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle ages, the black knight domains the kingdom with the army of evil, spreading chaos and darkness to the lands. In this dark place there are few ways to survive and many ways to die.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/ab7072cedb76c7e1fffa17358e68f451.poster.avif?t=1761699714\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/ab7072cedb76c7e1fffa17358e68f451.webm?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/ab7072cedb76c7e1fffa17358e68f451.mp4?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art visuals with an appropriate soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer dark dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURVIVAL HORROR elements: Limited resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular upgrades and items<strong>\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various dungeons to cross</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/168e29735adf4712a0d0dbc8bb1112ba.poster.avif?t=1761699714\" width=80 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364080/extras/168e29735adf4712a0d0dbc8bb1112ba.webm?t=1761699714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advices:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to run out of light during dungeons!</p></li><l